Hello,
Here is the Full Pass Test report for YP 2.1_M2.rc3.

Issue summary:

-        9131<https://bugzilla.yoctoproject.org/show_bug.cgi?id=3D9131> - W=
e found that for some BSPs (detected on 32bit, qemuarm and qemuppc) Applica=
tions can't be opened in SATO due matchbox issue.

-        9025<https://bugzilla.yoctoproject.org/show_bug.cgi?id=3D9025> - T=
he BA issue is still present. The fix was sent to the mailing list and will=
 be in during M3.

-        9126<https://bugzilla.yoctoproject.org/show_bug.cgi?id=3D9126> - T=
he P1022ds fsl BSP testing is blocked due to meta-fsl-ppc layer failing whe=
n trying to build openssl. The issue was fixed but still present in 2.1_M2.=
rc3

Other comments.

-        Removing static libraries did improve the build performance times =
(see patch here: http://git.yoctoproject.org/cgit.cgi/poky/commit/?id=3D9cb=
38c1eb54a37ca846585e305f6e85b1db041c8) with  1 minute on average for buildi=
ng the rootfs. Building core-image-sato-sdk with rm-work improved with an 3=
:45 minutes on average. The build performance charts can be consulted here:=
 https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/charts/perf_milestone/performance_test.html

